---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Woodsbridge Gutter Specialists" description="Privacy policy for Woodsbridge Gutter Specialists website.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Privacy Policy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>How we handle information on this website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>This is a static informational website. We do not operate user accounts or store personal form data on our servers. If you call or email us, the contact details you provide are used only to respond to your inquiry about gutter services.</p>
      <h2>Analytics &amp; Cookies</h2>
      <p>We may use standard web analytics or Cloudflare services that collect anonymous usage data (pages visited, approximate location, device type) to improve the site. No personally identifiable information is sold or shared for marketing.</p>
      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>This site may embed maps from OpenStreetMap. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, call (703) 555-0199 or write to us at 930 Highams Ct, Woodbridge, VA 22191.</p>
      <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
